WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Louise McCallum.

00:00:05.799 --> 00:00:07.700
No one ever really said much about her.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.640
Just that I had a great aunt who died young.

00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:13.500
Guessing they never mentioned she had a husband.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:15.160
No.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.100
But I don't think you can blame them.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.420
You were convicted of her murder.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:21.920
Yeah.

00:00:22.719 --> 00:00:24.120
You were so anxious to see me.

00:00:24.179 --> 00:00:25.640
Why'd you wait all these years to write?

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.000
Your aunt Nell, she asked me not to.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.039
I don't mean to be rude, Mr. McCallum,

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:37.560
but even if I did believe your story,

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:39.019
I don't know what you want me to do.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.920
I just need someone in Louise's family to know

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:45.380
I truly love my wife.

00:00:45.859 --> 00:00:47.400
I'm not the man who killed her.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:55.340
Louise!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:00.299
Louise!

00:01:02.299 --> 00:01:05.040
It was 42 years ago,

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:07.840
