00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.599
When I saw your picture in the paper,

00:01:46.719 --> 00:01:49.240
I couldn't get over how much you looked like Louise.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:50.780
I thought,

00:01:50.939 --> 00:01:53.219
